                                                "sense_id": "aec78688-0803-3d00-afd9-9964b9b0fbea",
                                                "text": "In the end of the 90s we call^([sic]) this software spyware, there was a term for it, and now we don't use this term anymore because most of the software that we use is spyware […]"
                                            }
